emFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">谷歌确认Gemini赋能新版Siri，苹果情境感知功能定档2026年发布</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">谷歌发布第八代TPU与Gemini企业代理平台，构建自主智能体基础设施</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 在 ChatGPT 中推出 Workspace Agents 团队协作智能体</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里腾讯竞投DeepSeek估值冲刺200亿美元，DeepSeek v4与混元3.0发布在即</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/55cd20e5e281fb1010cbbda20e45f998.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴与腾讯正寻求参与国产大模型厂商DeepSeek的新一轮融资，受此大厂竞逐驱动，DeepSeek估值目标已从此前传闻的100亿美元飙升至超过200亿美元。产品层面，DeepSeek预计于本月内发布新一代模型DeepSeek v4，核心升级在于引入多模态处理能力。与此同时，腾讯自研模型混元（Hunyuan）3.0预计于本周发布，该版本由前OpenAI核心研究员姚顺雨主导，可能采取约30B参数级别的轻量化设计，旨在降低部署成本与推理延迟。当前国产大模型竞争已从参数规模竞赛转向多模态能力与端侧落地潜力的全方位角逐。DeepSeek与腾讯混元在技术路径上的差异化布局，正推动国内AI产业投融资格局与技术标准的重塑，资本正向具备核心算法优势的团队高度集中。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里云发布开源模型Qwen3.6-27B，编程能力超越397B参数模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e0d1b9e6fc336b05a523f60f879d67f1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里云通义千问团队正式开源270亿参数稠密多模态模型Qwen3.6-27B。该模型在保持稠密架构的基础上，针对智能体编程与多模态推理进行深度优化。性能方面，Qwen3.6-27B在SWE-bench Verified代码修复测试中取得77.2分，编程能力全面超越参数量达3970亿的前代模型Qwen3.5-397B-A17B，显著降低了旗舰级编程辅助的部署门槛。在多模态领域，该模型原生支持图像、视频与文本混合输入，视觉推理能力与Qwen3.6-35B-A3B持平。目前，模型权重已上线Hugging Face与ModelScope社区，支持本地化部署。阿里云百炼平台将提供API调用服务，并保留“preserve_thinking”功能以回溯思维链。此外，该模型已实现对Claude Code、Qwen Code等主流</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌确认Gemini赋能新版Siri，苹果情境感知功能定档2026年发布</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a7316f68774f6e6fc7d9df69c8d0893f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在Google Cloud Next26大会上，谷歌正式确认苹果已选定其为首选云服务提供商，双方正基于Gemini模型共同开发下一代Apple Foundation机型，具备情境感知能力的全新Siri定档2026年发布。此次合作旨在将Gemini的多模态处理能力与苹果私有云计算架构结合，解决Siri在复杂指令遵循及跨应用意图识别上的短板。苹果通过每年约10亿美元投入，将Gemini大模型能力提炼至端侧可控版本，在保障隐私前提下提升iPhone及iPad的交互上限。此举标志着苹果从自研单一路径转向“自研+顶级外援”的双轨战略。行业分析认为，Siri的此次迭代预示着AI Agent步入生产力阶段，全球智能终端市场将迎来从“指令交互”向“意图理解”的范式转移，谷歌在模型底层架构的竞争优势进一步巩固。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布第八代TPU与Gemini企业代理平台，构建自主智能体基础设施</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a2d13c6841a624df8b396426a2099a65.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在Cloud Next &#x27;26大会上，谷歌正式发布第八代TPU及Gemini企业代理平台，旨在构建“代理企业”核心基础设施。底层算力方面，TPU v8被拆分为训练版TPU8t与推理版TPU8i，通过Virgo网络可支持百万级TPU集群互联，TPU8i通过增大片上SRAM及Boardfly拓扑结构显著降低推理延迟。软件层面，基于Vertex AI的Gemini企业代理平台引入Agent Studio，支持多步骤流程执行与长期记忆，并配套加密身份验证及异常检测等安全工具。此外，新增的Workspace Intelligence层打通Gmail、Docs及Drive，使Gemini 3.1 Pro及Claude Opus 4.7等模型能跨应用处理复杂任务。此次更新标志着谷歌将AI重心从聊天助手转向自主智能体，通过软硬</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 在 ChatGPT 中推出 Workspace Agents 团队协作智能体</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e189c960baf28424a890510b7398c525.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 于 4 月 23 日发布 Workspace Agents，旨在通过 ChatGPT 平台支持团队构建协作智能体，处理复杂任务与长周期工作流。该功能由 Codex 提供底层支持，具备文件处理、代码运行、工具调用及记忆存储能力，支持全天候云端运行。Workspace Agents 能够执行多步骤操作，并支持定时调度与 Slack 集成，适用于自动回答问题、提交工单及整合销售线索等场景。OpenAI 内部已部署软件审查员、周度指标报告员等 5 种应用实例，通过将隐性知识转化为显性工作流，提升团队协作效率。目前，该功能已面向 ChatGPT Business、Enterprise、Edu 及 Teachers 计划用户开放研究预览，在 2026 年 5 月 6 日前可免费使用，此后将转为积分计费模式。未</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
